3101:
X resolver Error\n
Failure in X resolver signal on\n
channel %.f\n
X signal is less than noise value\n
\t\n
Check resolver and resolver connections.\n
Replace measurement boards
3102:
Y resolver Error\n
Failure in Y resolver signal on\n
channel %.f\n
Y signal is less than noise value\n
\t\n
Check resolver and resolver connections\n
Replace measurement boards
