3148:
Axis Computer Error\n
Axis computer was stopped with\n
hw interrupt due to miscellaneous error\n
\t\n
Check system configuration\n
Reload system\n
Replace robot computer board
3151:
Axis Comp Output Overflow\n
Axis computer was stopped with hw\n
interrupt due to output overflow error\n
\t\n
Reload system\n
Replace robot computer board
3152:
Axis Computer Drive Unit\n
Axis computer was stopped with\n
hw interrupt due to drive unit error\n
\t\n
