Reload system\n
Replace drive unit
3153:
Axis Comp Tach Overflow\n
Axis computer was stopped with\n
interrupt due to tachometer register\n
overflow\n
\t\n
Check system configuration and restart\n
system\n
Reload system\n
Replace drive unit
3154:
Axis Computer XY Overflow\n
Axis computer was stopped with\n
hw interrupt due to X, Y register\n
overflow\n
\t\n
Restart system and check\n
synchronization\n
Reload system
3155:
Axis Computer RC Overflow\n
Axis computer was stopped with\n
hw interrupt due to ring controller\n
register overflow\n
\t\n
Restart system and check rev. counters\n
Reload system
3156:
Transmission failure\n
Contact lost with serial measurement\n
system. Axis computer stopped\n
due to transmission timeout.\n
\t\n
Check connections from cabinet to robot\n
and serial measurement board(s).\n
Replace measurement board or\n
robot computer
3157:
Transmission failure\n
Axis computer detected failure in\n
transmission to/from serial\n
measurement system.\n
\t\n
Check connections/cables for serial\n
measurement system. Check shieldings\n
Check for high electromagnetic\n
disturbances along cable run to robot\n
Replace measure board or robot computer
