7001:
Contactor activate Error\n
Motor On contactor did not activate/\n
energize\n
\t\n
Restart system\n
Check temp. switch in main transformer\n
Check/replace contactors (M.On/AUX)\n
Replace Supervisory contactor KM3 or\n
system board
8001:
Battery backup lost\n
Battery backup on serial measurement\n
board %.f\n
lost since last\n
power down or restart\n
\t\n
Check battery voltage during power off\n
after 18 hours recharging in power on\n
Check battery connection to serial\n
measurement board\n
Replace battery
8010:
Serial Board not found\n
Serial measurement board %.f not found\n
\t\n
Check system configuration parameters\n
Check connections and cables to\n
serial measurement system\n
Replace serial measurement board
8011:
Data Transmission Error\n
Failure in transmission of data to/from\n
serial measurement board %.f\n
\t\n
Check connections and cables to serial\n
measurement system. Check shieldings\n
Check for high electromagnetic\n
disturbances along cable run\n
Replace measure board or robot computer
8012:
Serial Offset X Error\n
Offset error in X signal on serial\n
measurement board %.f\n
\t\n
Replace serial measurement board
8013:
Serial Offset Y Error\n
Offset error in Y signal on serial\n
measurement board %.f\n
\t\n
Replace serial measurement board
8014:
Serial Linearity Error\n
Linearity error in X-Y signal difference\n
on serial measurement board %.f\n
- System may still operate with warning\n
- System will not function with error\n
\t\n
Replace serial measurement board
8015:
Serial Linear X Error\n
Linearity error in X signal on serial\n
measurement board %.f\n
\t\n
Replace serial measurement board
8016:
Serial Linear Y Error\n
Linearity error in Y signal on serial\n
measurement board %.f\n
\t\n
Replace serial measurement board
