8020:
Parallel Offset DA Error\n
Offset exceeds tolerance error D/A\n
converter on channel %.f on axes board\n
\t\n
Use different measurement channel\n
Replace axes board
8021:
Parallel Linearity DA-AD\n
Linearity error in D/A and A/D converter\n
