parameters
9001:
Drive System Error\n
DC-link is not connected\n
\t\n
Insert DC-link\n
Replace DC-link
9002:
Drive System Error\n
DC-link Power-up status wrong\n
\t\n
Restart system\n
Replace DC-link
9003:
Drive System Error\n
DC-link output voltage too high\n
\t\n
Check connection to shunt resistor\n
Replace DC-link
9004:
Drive System Error\n
DC-link voltage not valid\n
\t\n
Check voltage from Motor On contactor\n
Replace DC-link
9005:
Drive System Error\n
DC-link temperature too high\n
\t\n
Check cooling fan(s) or air conditioner\n
Check AC voltage to DC-link\n
Modify user progam\n
Replace DC-link
9006:
Drive System Error\n
Shunt temperature too high\n
\t\n
Too much deceleration\n
Modify user progam\n
Check AC voltage to DC-link\n
Replace DC-link
9007:
Drive System Error\n
+/- 15V out of limit\n
\t\n
Check +/- 15V from power supply\n
Replace DC-link
9008:
Drive System Error\n
Low current fault on drive unit %.f\n
\t\n
Check for broken wires\n
Check if motion parameter Mains\n
tolerance min correspond to\n
real mains.\n
Check/replace the drive unit
9009:
Drive System Error\n
Current too high on drive unit %.f\n
\t\n
Check if motor or motor circuit is\n
short circuit\n
Check/replace drive unit
9010:
Drive System Error\n
Temperature too high on drive unit %.f\n
\t\n
Check cooling fan(s) or air conditioner\n
Modify user progam\n
Check/replace drive unit
